Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 19:42:26 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1391/1399] HERESY 1434: the guard: nothing made without a
 workspace that takes new takes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 14.10.2026: «если пространство не выбрано, ничего не генерим нигде… В наши 💎 пространства и их сабы - запрет генерации». One guard before every way a take is made (the engine's runs, Replace a section, Import): the library read first; a workspace in hand that takes new takes (never a 💎 set, its sections or a frozen one), else the question (runs sent together share it), else nothing sent; a Librarian that does not answer sends nothing, said why; a studio with no Librarian at all keeps nothing from being made. The only workspace that takes new takes comes into hand unasked; a new install gets «My songs». An import lands in the workspace in hand; a take just made shows in the Takes column before the library has heard of it. The takes' list keeps its rule: the shield says its name, its tip stays on the Librarian's cards.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
